Subject: [PATCH] fix(facts): what the owner only relays from the web is
 mentioned, and never replaces their stated word (3235, second half)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

MASTER TEST RUN ME-023 (seat 180021): „ინტერნეტში წერია, რომ ბახვა
„სანიმუშო ბანკში" მუშაობს" was saved as the owner's own employer, over the
one they had stated. Two server-side changes, no new text:

- save_contact_fact saves as mentioned when the owner's line relays the
  web or others (ინტერნეტში წერია, ამბობენ, I read online, говорят …).
- A mentioned value for a core field (one value per field) that would
  replace the owner's own stated row is kept beside it as a private note
  („employer: …"), and the stated row stays.

